  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can cause life force to linger on the threshold of death or slip quickly away.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Ebbing Flow<sup>MIM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As long as you have at least 1 point in your ki pool, you gain the benefit of a constant deathwatch spell with regard to creatures within 5 feet times your mythic tier. When you use bleed, deathwatch, or stabilize as a spell-like ability, you can expend one use of your mythic power to use the mythic version of that effect. If you expend ki to gain enhanced blindsense, you add your mythic tier to your Wisdom modifier to determine its range, and it functions as blindsight with respect to creatures taking bleed damage or who have negative levels, in addition to disabled or dying creatures.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
